<title>CHINA: HK's non-China Asian air cargo rankings little changed.</title>
<headline>HK's non-China Asian air cargo rankings little changed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taipei remained Hong Kong's leading air cargo trading partner for both exports and imports during May, latest statistics from HK's Civil Aviation Department show.</p>
<p>Tokyo Narita was the second busiest export destination, followed by Anchorage and the orddr of most others was also unchanged.</p>
<p>Frankfurt was again the leading European airport of entry for Hong Kong goods during the month.</p>
